 "turns": [
  {
   "turn_id": "C50-D001",
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "案内を出す前に、借りた説明用の機械も確認しましょう。まさか、もう壊れたんですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C50-D001-S01",
    "C50-D001-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 0.0,
   "end_sec": 6.621,
   "duration_sec": 6.621
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C50-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "動きません。つまみを回しても同じです。いくら回しても、音が出ません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C50-D002-S01",
    "C50-D002-S02",
    "C50-D002-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 6.971,
   "end_sec": 12.382,
   "duration_sec": 5.411
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C50-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "電池入れを見ましょう。電池のマイナス側が逆ですね。まずスイッチを切ってください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C50-D003-S01",
    "C50-D003-S02",
    "C50-D003-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 12.732,
   "end_sec": 18.173,
   "duration_sec": 5.441
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C50-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "パチッと音がしました。ふたの爪を折らないように外しますね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C50-D004-S01",
    "C50-D004-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 18.523,
   "end_sec": 23.229,
   "duration_sec": 4.706
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C50-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "かちっと閉まりました。今はリモコンでも動かせます。小さい機械でも、確認が必要ですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C50-D005-S01",
    "C50-D005-S02",
    "C50-D005-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 23.579,
   "end_sec": 30.545,
   "duration_sec": 6.966
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C50-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "はい。電源を使う別の機械は、片付ける時にプラグをコンセントから抜いてください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C50-D006-S01",
    "C50-D006-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 30.895,
   "end_sec": 36.614,
   "duration_sec": 5.719
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C50-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "もし当日、機械が動かないとしたら、どうしますか。予算は三千円ですよね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C50-D007-S01",
    "C50-D007-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 36.964,
   "end_sec": 43.448,
   "duration_sec": 6.484
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C50-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "ええ、紙とペンに使います。機械は使えないとしましょう。それでもカードの紹介はできます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C50-D008-S01",
    "C50-D008-S02",
    "C50-D008-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 43.798,
   "end_sec": 50.581,
   "duration_sec": 6.783
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C50-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "紙とペンだけでは、会を開けませんよね。部屋まで使えなくなったら、どうしますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C50-D009-S01",
    "C50-D009-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 50.931,
   "end_sec": 56.844,
   "duration_sec": 5.913
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C50-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "万一そうなったら延期します。別室は借りません。日が未定なら、申込みも再開できません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C50-D010-S01",
    "C50-D010-S02",
    "C50-D010-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 57.194,
   "end_sec": 63.788,
   "duration_sec": 6.594
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C50-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "どう考えても、連絡の準備が先ですね。メールを読まない人にさえ変更を伝えるには、電話も必要です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C50-D011-S01",
    "C50-D011-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 64.138,
   "end_sec": 71.745,
   "duration_sec": 7.607
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C50-D012",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "私が連絡します。二月三日十八時までに相談してもらえば、返事は四日十八時まで待ちます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C50-D012-S01",
    "C50-D012-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 72.095,
   "end_sec": 78.999,
   "duration_sec": 6.904
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C50-D013",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "私は代筆をします。書く代わりに、言葉を選ぶ時間を長く取ってもらいましょう。佐藤さんも来られますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C50-D013-S01",
    "C50-D013-S02",
    "C50-D013-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 79.349,
   "end_sec": 86.521,
   "duration_sec": 7.172
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C50-D014",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "まだ分かりません。二人でできるようにしてください。そうそう予定は変えられませんが、できれば参加します。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C50-D014-S01",
    "C50-D014-S02",
    "C50-D014-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 86.871,
   "end_sec": 93.462,
   "duration_sec": 6.591
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C50-D015",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "分かりました。どんなに忙しくても、前日に十分くらいは最終確認をしましょう。準備中にけがでもしたら困りますから。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C50-D015-S01",
    "C50-D015-S02",
    "C50-D015-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
